cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Nitro, please cite our CCS 2025 paper."
title: "Nitro: High-Performance Tamper-Evident Logging with eBPF"
abstract: "Nitro is a high-performance, tamper-evident logging system built entirely on Linux eBPF. It ensures forward security and offers provable security guarantees through the XLog secure logging protocol."
